  "events": [
    {
      "text": "A carved wooden net shuttle on folded blue cloth, prompted by the Smithsonian’s Nanticoke net shuttle: https://americanindian.si.edu/collections-search/object/NMAI_36223 . I want the inner opening to stay crisp while the far edge of the cast shadow dissolves into the cloth.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9880,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The diagonal shadow already crosses the blue folds. I’ll build the two wood rails around an opening and leave that softer shadow exposed below.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6240,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "The narrow dark bevel keeps the cutout clear at both distances. The wood still seems to float at the left tip, so I’m bringing the contact shadow closer under that end.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8060,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1.9697318028789144,
        "x": 0.4998939643823791,
        "y": 0.4997092458367466
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "The grain marks follow the bevel and disappear before the tips. I’ll try one muted cord loop below the wood to see whether it reads beside the soft folds.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 29
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.7532722513089005
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 29
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "The second pass softened the sharpest turn of the loop. Its muted color keeps it below the wood in attention. A couple of warmer touches should make the cord meet the heel.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 33
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 37
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "The wider cloth washes are quiet at whole view, and I can still read the sharper opening against the soft cast shadow. I’ll try one short edge light where the upper rail turns.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
