    {
      "text": "The slack in the line is finished at 46 marks. The darker bevel keeps the opening clear and the blue edge of the cast shadow fades into the cloth. The little glint holds at whole view. At 2×, there’s still a kink in the cord and a regular pattern in the oil ridges. I’ll leave those here.",
      "kind": "notice",
